# docs/libs/ — lib documentation mount point
#
# macOS / Linux: symlinks (committed, recreated on clone)
#   docs/libs/billing  →  ../../../../lib/billing/docs/
#
# Windows / CI production build: copy script
#   mise run docs:sync   (runs scripts/docs-sync.mjs)
#   copies lib/*/docs/ → docs/libs/*/
#
# To add a new lib:
#   1. Create lib/{name}/docs/*.md
#   2. Add symlink (macOS/Linux):
#        cd systems/docs/website/docs/libs
#        ln -s ../../../../lib/{name}/docs {name}
#   3. Add to scripts/docs-sync.mjs libs[] array
#   4. Add sidebar entry in .vitepress/config.ts
